  "notes": [
    "**Reír** is a stem-changing verb: e→í with spelling changes",
    "Present: stem change e→í (except nosotros where it's reímos with accent)",
    "Preterite: accents on all forms (reí, reíste, rió, reímos, rieron)",
    "Imperfect: regular -IR pattern with accent on \"í\" (reía, reías, etc.)",
    "Often used reflexively: **reírse (de)** = to laugh (at)",
    "Common usage: *Me río mucho* (I laugh a lot), *reírse de un chiste* (to laugh at a joke)",
    "Related verb: **sonreír** (to smile) - conjugates the same way"
  ],
